{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This <strong>free demo</strong> offers an exclusive look at the <strong>prologue of the story. </strong>Dive into the <strong>opening chapter</strong>, where you'll explore the atmosphere, mechanics, and core features that set the stage for the full game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This prologue serves as a standalone introduction, while the complete game will continue the journey with more chapters</strong>, expanding on the story, characters, and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like this demo, make sure you wishlist the full game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHOREOGRAPHED EVENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435410/extras/stoned-dialogue.gif?t=1743519059\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a world where the story unfolds around you in real-time through scripted events. No cutscenes, no interruptions\u2014just you in control. Dive into conversations, eavesdrop, or walk away\u2014it's your call.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PHYSICAL INTERACTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435410/extras/stoned-interaction-01.gif?t=1743519059\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with the world naturally, pulling, pushing, and grabbing. Every action feels tactile, opening the door to immersive and quirky gameplay moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IMMERSIVE ENVIRONMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435410/extras/stoned-ambience.gif?t=1743519059\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lose yourself in a meticulously crafted environment. PSX-ish style visuals, rich soundscapes and sound effects bring every moment to life.\u00a0Hear sounds change as you move, get muffled behind walls, or echo in certain spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contextual dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realtime choreographed cutscenes and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physical interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive volumetric audio</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist now to get updates and be the first to experience the haunting mystery when it releases!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3435410?t=1743519059","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435410/491388747864791a0932ef41148f0910e7b21b3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743519059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435410/d78f9939dabfcff5f311e55fd137f92e720e8b2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743519059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435410/d78f9939dabfcff5f311e55fd137f92e720e8b2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743519059","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This <strong>free demo</strong> offers an exclusive look at the <strong>prologue of the story. </strong>Dive into the <strong>opening chapter</strong>, where you'll explore the atmosphere, mechanics, and core features that set the stage for the full game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This prologue serves as a standalone introduction, while the complete game will continue the journey with more chapters</strong>, expanding on the story, characters, and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like this demo, make sure you wishlist 